      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY – NEW YEAR 2025 🎉\n Cyberabad Traffic Police\n\n📅 31st December 2025 | From 8:00 PM onwards\n\n🚖 CABS / TAXI / AUTO DRIVERS\n\n✔️ Must wear proper uniform & carry documents\n❌ Refusal of ride is an offence (Sec 178 MVA)\n❌ No excess fares or misbehavior\n📲 Complaints: WhatsApp 9490617346\n\n🍻 BARS / PUBS / CLUBS\n\n⚠️ Do NOT allow drunk customers to drive\n⚠️ Management will be prosecuted for abetment\n✔️ Educate customers & arrange safe transport\n\n🚔 FOR GENERAL PUBLIC\n\nSpecial cameras for:\n• Wrong-side driving\n• Signal jumping\n• Overspeeding\n• Rash driving\n• No helmet / parking violations\n\n🍺 Drunk & Drive checks across Cyberabad\n📄 Vehicles detained if documents not produced\n🔊 High-decibel music, no number plates = seizure\n👶 Minor driving = vehicle detention + prosecution\n\n🚨 DRUNK & DRIVING – STRICT ACTION\n\n Fine up to ₹10,000 / Jail up to 6 months (1st offence)\n ₹15,000 / Jail up to 2 years (repeat offence)\n🚫 DL suspension / permanent cancellation\n Fatal accident → Arrest under BNS 2023\n Celebrate Responsibly. Drive Safely. Arrive Home Alive.\n\n Cyberabad Traffic Police\n For your safety, always on duty\n\n#TrafficAdvisory #NewYear2025 #CyberabadTrafficPolice\n#DrinkAndDrive #RoadSafety #CelebrateResponsibly\n#SafeNewYear #TrafficRules #PublicSafety",
